Kekuatan sekarang.

01:42:42.189 --> 01:42:43.190
Muncul juga.

01:42:48.328 --> 01:42:49.329
Aduh, hampir saja.

01:42:49.496 --> 01:42:49.763
Ulzzang.

01:42:50.197 --> 01:42:51.198
Oljjang, oljjang, oljjang.

01:42:54.801 --> 01:42:55.802
Ah, ada, ada, ada.

01:42:56.803 --> 01:42:58.071
Tapi ternyata kau diam-diam
menganggapnya keren, ya?

01:42:58.705 --> 01:42:59.473
Keren, keren banget.

01:42:59.673 --> 01:43:01.742
Keren juga. Mangonya
sudah nggak kelihatan?

01:43:01.875 --> 01:43:03.143
Sekarang.
Lihat saja.
Apaan tuh.

01:43:03.443 --> 01:43:04.011
Lihat saja, lihat saja.

01:43:04.211 --> 01:43:06.947
Lihat saja. Ah, lihat,
lihat, lihat. Selamat Natal!

01:43:25.132 --> 01:43:25.599
Hmm.

01:43:26.033 --> 01:43:26.733
Enak banget.

01:43:26.867 --> 01:43:30.370
Kalau pakai kertas,
mangganya jadi enak. Mangga.

01:44:45.345 --> 01:44:48.448
Ini diskon setengah
harga, jadi 70 yen.

01:44:49.216 --> 01:44:52.486
Totalnya 370 yen.

01:45:05.132 --> 01:45:06.133
Terima kasih.

01:45:06.800 --> 01:45:07.801
Terima kasih.

01:45:11.238 --> 01:45:14.508
Jangan ditinggal begitu.
Nah, tempelkan di sini.

01:45:16.310 --> 01:45:16.543
Woi!

01:45:16.610 --> 01:45:17.611
Mendekatlah!

01:45:19.513 --> 01:45:19.813
Woi!

01:45:20.180 --> 01:45:21.181
Woi!

01:45:29.990 --> 01:45:32.192
Kalau aku berusaha, ya
batang, kalau kubantu, ya batang.

01:45:32.359 --> 01:45:34.761
Amplopnya hilang.
Amplopnya hilang?

01:45:36.963 --> 01:45:37.964
Oi

01:45:42.969 --> 01:45:45.472
Waduh, gawat gawat
gawat. Ngeri ngeri ngeri ngeri.

01:46:15.335 --> 01:46:22.142
Tolong bantu dia. Tolong! Dia sepertinya merasa
terganggu. Tolong! Ayo kita semua bikin pesta bareng!

01:46:44.998 --> 01:46:47.567
Selamat Natal!

01:46:48.535 --> 01:46:49.736
Yey!

01:46:49.836 --> 01:46:51.905
Semuanya, ayo seru-seruan!
